      kind: 'Article',
      subjects: ['tulip'],
      image: image('Neutral wireframe placeholder for a battery assembly line'),
    },
    {
      title: 'Choosing between standard and custom packs',
      excerpt: 'Standard packs are qualified and ready to integrate. Custom packs make sense when space, energy or environment demand it.',
      href: '#choosing-between-standard-and-custom-packs',
      publishedAt: '2026-08-28',
      kind: 'Article',
      subjects: ['battery-packs', 'custom-packs'],
      image: image('Neutral wireframe placeholder for two battery packs side by side'),
    },
    {
      title: 'Electric motorcycles with a lighter pack',
